          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abezihonqo zakoRubeni, ngamabandla abo, abayizinkulungwane ezilikhulu lamatshumi amahlanu lanye, lamakhulu amane, lamatshumi amahlanu, bazakuba ngabesibili ekusukeni kwabantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
