              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labo abazamisa eceleni kwabakoEfrayimi ngabesizwe sakoManase, isikhulu sabo sibe nguGamaliyeli indodana kaPedazuri; ",
          "type": "text",
